{"component_id_namespace":"ec077a53-0b40-5f21-b1fe-a62094d2476b","component_schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","components":[{"attributes":{"code":"TMC","legacy_node_id":"ks-topeka:tmc:3.30.390","page_type":"section"},"citation":"3.30.390","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/3.30.390","content_hash":"32e7ba50aff20ca87acec687c81f9a16bbc4b71af3b6c9f1c8adae9c3687dde7","heading":"Definitions.","ordinal":0,"parent_source_component_key":null,"schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:3.30.390:section","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/3.30.390","text":"In addition to the definitions found in TMC 2.25.010 , the following words, terms and phrases, when used in this article, shall have the meanings ascribed to them in this section, except where the context clearly indicates a different meaning:\n“Bid” means the amount of labor and material required to do a specific contract work by a contractor.\n“Contractor” means the party who is to do the work if the bid is approved that the contractor submits. (Ord. 18263 § 15, 6-8-04. Code 1981 § 13-135. Code 1995 § 42-62.)\nCross References: Definitions generally, TMC 1.10.020 .","type":"section","workbench_component_id":"6279b2c4-e58f-5731-863e-00c787e9ecac"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"3.30.390","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/3.30.390","content_hash":"2d42a8f5e98844514b6cb9b661b860d849e2357ac91df763975969dc96bf07fa","heading":null,"ordinal":0,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:3.30.390:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:3.30.390:block:0","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/3.30.390","text":"In addition to the definitions found in TMC 2.25.010 , the following words, terms and phrases, when used in this article, shall have the meanings ascribed to them in this section, except where the conte